WEBVTT

00:16:27.607 --> 00:16:31.278
the image was in Berlin,
Dusseldorf, Venice this morning.

00:16:31.319 --> 00:16:34.156
And then it will keep traveling
and each time, each place,

00:16:34.156 --> 00:16:37.034
people are gathering by themselves
and opening it up.

00:16:37.075 --> 00:16:38.910
HW: That is amazing, JR, thank you.

00:16:38.910 --> 00:16:40.078
JR: Thank you.

00:16:40.078 --> 00:16:43.915
(Applause)